    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "So, it's just like [上]?\n計算から言えばこれで正しい is a correct sentence?",
      "html": "So, it's just like [上]?<br/>計算から言えばこれで正しい is a correct sentence?",
      "credits_raw": "Jordi",
      "content_sha256": "64cf3696945c8f0a45a1c2c36fccb655bbc2fd6a3d52328894330711d70584b6",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Yes, it is. You can also say like 計算上(で)は、これで正しい。hmm it's just like 上.",
      "html": "Yes, it is. You can also say like 計算上(で)は、これで正しい。hmm it's just like 上.",
      "credits_raw": "Miki",
      "content_sha256": "c8052fe9cc284b803249df163b08238a47c6b6136f10ce16b5bb9b6c277db256",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "is that 上 a [uede] or [jyoude] ? I guess from the example it is uede, which i thought was more \"upon\" than \"based on\" - ie implying a careful thought and conclusion. whereas \"based on\" is more like a conclusion is obvious, based on the information... is there that same difference in japanese or are they the same?",
      "html": "is that 上 a [uede] or [jyoude] ? I guess from the example it is uede, which i thought was more \"upon\" than \"based on\" - ie implying a careful thought and conclusion. whereas \"based on\" is more like a conclusion is obvious, based on the information... is there that same difference in japanese or are they the same?",
      "credits_raw": "your name",
      "content_sha256": "9f7133621db32e6f2cf5880fed9b67a64bd34b87f5c89e877f06f643dd297428",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 6,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "計算上(jou)（で）は、or 計算の上(ue)では",
      "html": "計算上(jou)（で）は、or 計算の上(ue)では",
      "credits_raw": "Miki",
      "content_sha256": "1d94d986dc20a2331e6a6412049fe92fc14bacc90144cc4b940d64f7666ae345",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 7,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Please see [uede].\nI don't think からいうと implys a careful thought and conclusion.",
      "html": "Please see [uede].<br/>I don't think からいうと implys a careful thought and conclusion.",
      "credits_raw": "Miki",
      "content_sha256": "76703ad7f592ae089d3d369b81d0011be01fe6fb6a865d95fd81676415ec709f",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 8,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "計算から言えばこれで正しい is somewhat awkward - 計算からするとこれで正しい is preferable.",
      "html": "計算から言えばこれで正しい is somewhat awkward - 計算からするとこれで正しい is preferable.",
